-- Hand-maintained catalog rows for concerts and series VocaDB does not carry.
--
-- 0001 deletes and rewrites every VocaDB catalog row, so this file runs after it.
-- Every INSERT is INSERT OR IGNORE: once `pnpm collect` writes the same upstream row into
-- 0001, the matching statement becomes a no-op and the row is not duplicated.
--
-- Sections, in file order:
--   1. ミクの日感謝祭39's Giving Day (VocaDB event 2520, standalone upstream event)
--   2. 初音ミク×鼓童 (VocaDB series 255)
--   3. MIKU WITH YOU 2026 in Chengdu (no VocaDB event)
--   4. デコミク LIVE starring 初音ミク『Hello』 (VocaDB event 9401, no series upstream)
--   5. Standalone lives with no VocaDB event at all
--   6. 初音ミクコンサート 最後のミクの日感謝祭 (no VocaDB event, filed under series 219)
--
-- Ids from 3,000,000,000 up are reserved for 演出 VocaDB does not list
-- (shared/repertoire.ts: LOCAL_PERFORMANCE_ID_BASE); local series ids start at 900,000,000.
-- Sources and per-row notes travel with each section below.


BEGIN;
-- Standalone VocaDB event that the collector now files under a recorded series.
-- Event 2520 has no series upstream; scripts/vocadb/collect.ts STANDALONE_EVENTS maps it to 219:2010.
-- Sources: https://vocadb.net/E/2520 and https://vocadb.net/L/3952. License: https://wiki.vocadb.net/docs/license
-- Retrieved: 2026-11-04T06:10:03.729Z
-- INSERT OR IGNORE makes this file a no-op once 0001 already carries the same rows.
